\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-No need for ECB action on euro now-Germany's Clement.  \b0\par\par\uc2 681 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 2004\par 19:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par     By Iain Rogers\par     BERLIN, Jan 28 (Reuters) - German Economy Minister Wolfgang\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Clement said on Wednesday the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  need not at  \f28 \par \par \uc2 present use a rate cut or \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the euro, but  \par \par \uc2 urged the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  to address the dollar's weakness.  \par \par \uc2 He also echoed two euro zone central bankers who earlier in  \par \par \uc2 the day played down the risk that the euro, up some 20 percent  \par \par \uc2 against the dollar since the start of 2003, could hurt recovery.  \par \par \uc2 But Italian Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi said the high  \par \par \uc2 euro was squeezing Italian exports at levels above $1.20 and  \par \par \uc2 looked forward to it returning to parity with the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "I hope the European economy knows how to react and that the  \par \par \uc2 difference between the euro and the dollar diminishes and we  \par \par \uc2 head towards a future in which there will be parity between the  \par \par \uc2 euro and the dollar," he told journalists in Rome.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     In Berlin, Clement made clear he was not appealing to the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to cut rates or to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the markets.\par    "I would not understand it in that way, and in any case there\par is no need for it at the moment," he told a news conference.\par     Clement said he was confident the ECB was closely monitoring\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the euro's exchange rate and that he had discussed the matter  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 with ECB President Jean-Claude Trichet at the World Economic  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Forum in Davos, Switzerland, which ended this weekend.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "I am sure, also after a short discussion with ECB President  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Trichet, that this development will be very closely watched by  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the ECB," Clement said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "We have seen a certain calming of the situation after some\par very sporadic \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  movements," he said.\par     "I am sure there is a pain barrier for German exporters,\par which I will not name here, but I expect the ECB will recognise\par it at the right time," he said.\par     Speaking on the sidelines of the news conference, Clement\par added: "The U.S. should also contribute to doing something\par against the dollar's decline."\par  \par     CENTRAL BANKERS AT EASE\par     Analysts said Clement's calm suggests the ECB president has\par convinced politicians he will not let the euro's strength abort\par recovery.\par     European politicians have recently expressed worries about\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 big \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swings, seeking to talk down the euro just ahead of  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 a meeting of the Group of Seven richest countries of the world  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 early next month.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The euro dropped off earlier record highs after their  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 statements, as markets started to speculate the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 might \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets or even lower interest rates  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to make euro-denominated debt less attractive for investors.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Euro zone central bankers joined Clement in signalling they  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 were satisfied with the first round of verbal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the ECB was not in a rush to move to further sap euro strength.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "My feeling is that in the recent period, the euro is more  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 stable than before because it's moving within a certain range at  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 this very moment, so I'm happy with the present developments,"  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ECB Governing Council member Nout Wellink from the Netherlands  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 told Reuters in an interview late on Tuesday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In a similar vein, Austrian ECB council member Klaus  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Liebscher was quoted as saying on Wednesday the strong euro's  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 detrimental effects on the euro zone should not be exaggerated.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The common position between central bankers and a minister  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 suggested the ECB had managed to reassure politicians that it  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 stands ready to act if the euro shot up further, analysts said  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - even if Europe does not win U.S. support at the upcoming G7  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 meeting and it will have to go it alone.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The ECB might well have reassured politicians it was not  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 neglecting the euro's strength by promising it would step into  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 markets if the single \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  soared to levels around $1.35.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A Reuters poll of economists on Wednesday suggested that if  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the euro continued its ascent against the dollar and rises to  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 $1.35, an ECB rate cut could be on the cards.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040128e01s002su\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
